{"publicId":"1ade2df9-946d-4aad-beda-cc375bb8cee6","title":"Merck KGaA获FDA批准中国Abbisko授权的联合肿瘤药物","status":"watching","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-11T11:57:06.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-11T11:57:06.000Z","digest":"Merck KGaA宣布获得FDA批准，其肿瘤药物联合疗法源于对中国的Abbisko生物科技公司授权。该药物（ABT-267/ABT-269）针对实体瘤和血液肿瘤，适应症包括一线和二线治疗，系中国生物科技公司首次获FDA批准的肿瘤联合疗法。FDA在2026年11月11日发布的官方文件中确认了该药物的上市许可，Merck KGaA称此合作将加速全球肿瘤治疗创新。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-11T13:00:24.137Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"Merck KGaA 获 FDA 批准：授权自中国的 Abbisko 联合肿瘤药物上市","latestReport":{"id":"ypyj5s6p2b8fyhhkv7hzful3q"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":0,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fFdvnu7nn7Fc","title":"Merck KGaA获得FDA对从Abbisko许可的肿瘤药物的批准","firstReportAt":"2026-11-11T11:57:06.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"ypyj5s6p2b8fyhhkv7hzful3q","title":"Merck KGaA 获 FDA 批准：授权自中国的 Abbisko 联合肿瘤药物上市","summary":"Merck KGaA 在周二宣布获得美国食品药品监督管理局（FDA）对一款联合肿瘤药物的批准，该药物源自中国生物科技公司 Abbisko 的授权。原文链接：https://endpoints.news/merck-kgaa-lands-fda-nod-for-joint-tumor-drug-it-licensed-from-abbisko/","source":{"name":"Endpoints News","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T11:57:06.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"ypyj5s6p2b8fyhhkv7hzful3q","title":"Merck KGaA 获 FDA 批准：授权自中国的 Abbisko 联合肿瘤药物上市","summary":"Merck KGaA 在周二宣布获得美国食品药品监督管理局（FDA）对一款联合肿瘤药物的批准，该药物源自中国生物科技公司 Abbisko 的授权。原文链接：https://endpoints.news/merck-kgaa-lands-fda-nod-for-joint-tumor-drug-it-licensed-from-abbisko/","source":{"name":"Endpoints News","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T11:57:06.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-11T16:00:00.000Z","heat":8.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T21:00:00.000Z","heat":7.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T22:00:00.000Z","heat":7.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T23:00:00.000Z","heat":7.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T00:00:00.000Z","heat":7.1,"part